  "summary": "I am a highly skilled and experienced Software Engineer with over 5 years of experience in the industry. I specialize in C#, Java, JavaScript, and React and have experience working on both front-end and back-end development (Tailwind, Bootstrap). I have a strong understanding of Agile methodologies and have worked with a variety of software development tools and frameworks, including .NET, jQuery, Vue.js and React.\n\nI pride myself on my ability to problem-solve and my desire to continuously learn and improve. I am committed to delivering high-quality, efficient, and user-friendly software solutions that meet the needs of my clients. UI/UX is one of my forte's and passions. I am a team player and I enjoy collaborating with others to create innovative and effective solutions in a modern era. I am excited to bring my skills and experience to a new opportunity and continue to grow as a software engineer.",
